description=Hello! This is a mod that makes you fight LIKE A DRAGON ( It's also a framework. https://github.com/SKYN1K/ProjectYakuza )

This mod was CODED by an AI. Every other asset was NOT made by an AI.

I recommend using the voice mod so your character has an actual voice when fighting. It's in the required items list.

Hold Z to open the Styles menu. There's only one style for now, I'll add more later.

Keybinds are changeable in the Zomboid's settings in Mods section. Same goes for sound.

This mod comes with a few sandbox options.

If you would like to suggest anything or report a bug please consider making a discussion or leave a comment if you're lazy like me

Kiryu's clothes, hair and face on the thumbnail are from this mod: https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3778724196
